    "sentence_translations": [
      "About to Die",
      "",
      "Xiao Bao: Grandma, we took a taxi home today and it was extremely fast.",
      "",
      "Grandma: What do you mean by “about to die”? Don’t talk nonsense.",
      "",
      "Xiao Bao: But dad says “extremely tired” every day when he comes back home.",
      "And mom often says “extremely busy”.",
      "The taxi driver drove very fast today, so why can't I say “extremely fast”?",
      "",
      "Grandma: Then you can say “very fast”.",
      "“Extremely fast” sounds like someone is about to die. Don’t say it anymore, sweetie.",
      "",
      "Xiao Bao: Ok…"
    ]
